    "Admin Home Studio exact VIEW/MANAGE authorization and tenant-only identity plane",
    "DB-filtered tenant configuration audit paging with a privacy allowlist",
    "Personal data-plane placement of trusted effective AVAILABLE registry definition keys",
    "Exact preservation of stored unavailable/deprecated dotted definitions across update, restore, device overlays, TEMPLATE, AI, and UNDO"
  ],
  "explicitExclusions": [
    "No Registry AUTHORITATIVE activation",
    "No legacyPlacementWrite, instanceV6Write, runtime broker, or canAdd activation",
    "No Wave 6 rollout",
    "No registry authority in Admin Home Template create/update/restore; tenant templates cannot add dynamic definitions"
  ],
